  "text": "Granted by Blade Byrnie, Blade Byrnie (Greater), Blade Byrnie (Major)\n\nYou pull a link from the armor, which transforms into a +1 striking dagger (+2 greater striking dagger for greater blade byrnie and +3 greater striking dagger for major blade byrnie). Upgrading the runes on the blade byrnie makes the daggers pulled from it more powerful. The daggers have a +2 weapon potency rune if the armor has a +2 armor potency rune, or a +3 weapon potency rune if the armor has a +3 armor potency rune.",
